{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026cxnw5Wrtdr1792721653.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>國家主席習近平對西藏那曲7級地震作出重要指示，強調要全力開展人員搜救，全力做好傷員救治工作，最大限度減少人員傷亡。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.XI-0930_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026lcz4bLZuYb1792721699.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>習近平強調，災區地處高海拔地區天氣寒冷，要密切監測震情和天氣變化，科學實施救援，防止發生次生災害。要加緊調撥搶險救援物資、妥善安置受災群眾、搶修受損基礎設施，切實保障民眾生命財產安全。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.XI-0930_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026iyeHIfStpe1792721713.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>國務院總理李強亦作出批示指出，指這次地震災區位於高海拔地區且餘震多發，應急管理部、地震局要同有關方面進一步加強地震監測預測，做好災害防範應對工作。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T03:05:17.900622+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":224,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T02:10:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T22:18:05.666311+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T02:58:06.495462+00:00","content_hash":"ec397449bd85c8edc895cfe98e8aa361bcc470d9bf22762519598791d4f48cea","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-23T03:05:17.900622+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}